#
# Provenance:
#
#   The file HighNESS_136H2O_8TDF_sg227_ClathrateHydrate-sII.ncmat from the
#   ClathrateHydrateData plugin (https://github.com/highness-eu/ncmat-
#   clathrates, commit 4efbea0). Only the VDOS of one element was kept,
#   written with up to 7 significant digits. This is the VDOS of the H atoms
#   of the H2O molecules.
#
#   According to the original file, structure and phonon density of states
#   were provided by Sara Laporte from Milano.
#
# Why it is a test case:
#
#   The VDOS is provided on a grid of 11001 points, of which 57% are exactly
#   zero (large gaps between the modes). The grid starts at the unusually low
#   energy of 0.04meV.
#
